    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_06Zol_40:FEV_Dng_06Zol_40_006:604d06b8",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Dng_06Zol_40",
        "key": "FEV_Dng_06Zol_40_006",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_06Zol_40:FEV_Dng_06Zol_40_006:604d06b8",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_06Zol_40:FEV_Dng_06Zol_40_006:604d06b8",
        "jp_sha256": "5d66d23654252d5c7c456280dfd766364f8da08eedd6d8f88ef51f595b0e3c88",
        "official_en_sha256": "d5e3dc399ca9d93acac53be65ba244c1ee8b719807f1b9f9db46a1d35f6f301c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": " 原因はこれから調査するのですが……\r\n 危険ですので安易に近づかれないようお願いします。",
        "official_en": "I am on my way to see if I can identify the cause. The area is incredibly dangerous—I would advise against any haphazard excursions there.",
        "real_en": "We still need to investigate the cause... But it's dangerous, so please don't go near the volcano without good reason."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_FEV_Dng_06Zol_40",
