        "key": "FEV_Dng_06Zol_40_003",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_06Zol_40:FEV_Dng_06Zol_40_003:8d35b93e",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_06Zol_40:FEV_Dng_06Zol_40_003:8d35b93e",
        "jp_sha256": "0b99d9a73bcfedd72147e49bc2510bd63cb9e40fcb54a2c3424bec0fae37070f",
        "official_en_sha256": "63d892a255d63a746d78b797591685531fb8e6de92d00299098c439253f45b5e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それを考えれば、\r\n今の子たちはかわいそうじゃ……。",
        "official_en": "But those days are long gone... And now the young folk have to live in this husk of a once-great nation.",
        "real_en": "Thinking back on those days makes me feel sorry for the children growing up now..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
