        "official_en_sha256": "1f5aaa104393b8a3bff650e643d98c42e98ac0ca1ddc424d3162563ea333cd78"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "まえ行った時も、帝都は空気が悪い、\r\nなんて言いながらピンピンしてたからな。\r\nまぁ、元気だろ。",
        "official_en": "She was still fiercely complaining about how dirty the air was last time we visited, so I’m sure she’s doing fine.",
        "real_en": null
      },
